Exactly ONE ```diff block, nothing outside it, containing TWO sections in this order:
1. `--- a/services/api-gateway/src/routes/system-status.ts` / `+++ b/services/api-gateway/src/routes/system-status.ts`, TWO hunks: `@@ -526,4 +526,4 @@` (context 526/527, one `-` at 528, one `+`, context 529) and `@@ -564,3 +564,20 @@` (**17** `+` lines, NONE of them empty, then context 564/565/566).
2. `--- /dev/null` / `+++ b/services/api-gateway/src/__tests__/ks1248-n-1-system-status-troubleshooting-marks.test.ts`, ONE hunk whose header's new-count equals the number of lines you actually emit, every line a `+`.

